WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
One booked appointment in five

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.640
just vanishes. Twenty one separate

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:05.880
studies found the same hole

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.220
in the schedule, and every

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.780
miss leaves paid staff beside

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.340
an empty chair. One friendly

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.080
text reminder cuts those no-shows

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.440
by about a quarter and

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:15.680
people really read them,

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.140
three out of four checking

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:18.600
a new message within five

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.120
minutes. An empty slot is

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.680
booked money walking out the

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.300
door, because nobody can sell

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.380
yesterday's hour. One text protects

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.840
the revenue that is already

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:28.880
sitting inside your calendar.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.520
Project Knox texts every customer

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:33.400
automatically booked, reminded, remembered while

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.000
you run the shop.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.040
Keep more chairs filled and

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.340
your schedule paid at get

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:39.540
project knox dot com.

